{"id":"conv_05087","context":"Two managers prep a leadership handover briefing","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["yuki_office","kenji_office"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"Kenji, do you have a little time to go over the handover briefing materials for next week?","jp":"健司さん、来週の引き継ぎ説明会の資料、少しお時間いただけますか？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,14,16,50,56,111,112,244,259,683,2693,2823,3077,3237,5964,19296],"jpTokens":[{"s":"健司","r":"けんじ"},{"s":"さん","w":50},{"s":"、"},{"s":"来週","r":"らいしゅう","w":3237},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"引き継ぎ","r":"ひきつぎ","w":19296},{"s":"説明","r":"せつめい","w":244},{"s":"会","r":"かい","w":112},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"資料","r":"しりょう","w":683},{"s":"、"},{"s":"少し","r":"すこし","w":259},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"いただけ","w":3077},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"？"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"Of course. First, the director's responsibilities are changing significantly with this reshuffle, so we need to explain that carefully.","jp":"もちろん。まず、今回の人事で部長の責務がかなり大きく変わるから、そこを丁寧に説明しないとね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,5,6,7,9,13,19,20,51,207,220,244,278,335,370,591,1014,1922,1988,2620,3156,3198,4487,9146,10213,13646,19874],"jpTokens":[{"s":"もちろん","w":335},{"s":"。"},{"s":"まず","w":370},{"s":"、"},{"s":"今回","r":"こんかい","w":207},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"人事","r":"じんじ","w":3198},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"部長","r":"ぶちょう","w":2620},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"責務","r":"せきむ","w":9146},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"かなり","w":278},{"s":"大きく","r":"おおきく","w":1014},{"s":"変わる","r":"かわる","w":1922},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"、"},{"s":"そこ","w":220},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"丁寧","r":"ていねい","w":3156},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"説明","r":"せつめい","w":244},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"Yes. Especially the delegation of budget approval authority — if it's misunderstood, it could cause trouble later.","jp":"ええ。特に予算決裁の権限移譲については、誤解されると後々もめそうな